      "id": "claim_735eae42a89d45429ecab08b9db7000a",
      "statement": "FeedService.subscribe performs an unconditional FeedFetcher.fetch, parses the response with FeedParser, saves a new Feed row with pollIntervalMinutes defaulted from myfeeder.polling.default-interval-minutes (default 15), and publishes FeedSavedEvent(saved) via ApplicationEventPublisher.",
