      "statement": "FeedPollingScheduler listens for FeedSavedEvent and FeedDeletedEvent via @TransactionalEventListener(phase = AFTER_COMMIT, fallbackExecution = true), and registers all existing feeds on ApplicationReadyEvent via onStartup().",
